<title>USA: Bay Pond holds 6.91 pct Wayne stake.</title>
<headline>Bay Pond holds 6.91 pct Wayne stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bay Pond Partners L.P. said Friday it held a 6.91 percent stake in Wayne Bancorp, or 154,700 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Bay Pond said its bought the stake on June 27 at prices ranging from $10.9562 to $11.1719 per share.</p>
<p>Bay Pond said it bought the shares for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
